msgctxt "284"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! How did it go? You manage to get that Ryukyu sea bream?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Oh, yes... Of course. What would you like to do today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "I've changed my mind. I'm good for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Oh, sure. But, um... don't forget about that Ryukyu sea bream, okay? Please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Let's see what you've got for me today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Yes, sir! I've got all the fresh fish you could ever need!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Thanks for trying! Ryukyu sea bream, okay? Please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "I'd like to sell you some fish, if that's okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Oh, of course! What were you thinking of selling today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Thanks for trying! Ryukyu sea bream, okay? Please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Actually... I haven't been to that restaurant yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Give me a break! It's on Hatsumachi South. Place called Sansui, right by "
"Karaokekan! Please, I'm beggin' you here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "The restaurant next to South Island on Hatsumachi South. I'm on my way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"(The chef is saying he'll sell it back for three times the price⑬300,000 "
"yen.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"(Triple the price!? What the hell? That's practically extortion... but what "
"choice do I have?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"(Here's another 100,000... That should bring what I gave you up to 300,000 "
"yen. He better not push his luck!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Huh? Everything okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Huh? Oh! Nothing! He'll be right back with your Ryukyu sea bream! Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Yeah. Don't worry. I'll figure something out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Good, good... I'll keep my fingers crossed. Thank you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Yeah. Here you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "You handed over the <Color:8>Ryukyu Sea Bream<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "You did it! You really did it! There it is... This is the fish!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"And what a beautiful Ryukyu sea bream it is! My daughter and her husband "
"will be thrilled!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Thank you so much for your help, Kiryu-san. You really saved my neck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Don't mention it. Oh, and by the way..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "(It took 300,000 yen to get that fish back in the end.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "(What!? Another 100,000 on top of what I'd given you? But...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"Well, here's 100,000 yen for the fish. Let me know if any other good stuff "
"comes in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Of course! Please come again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"Well... This never would have happened if I hadn't sold the fish in the "
"first place. I'll pay you back your 100,000..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"I guess my customer's trust is priceless, but... urgh, I wasn't expecting "
"it to be so steep..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"Don't ever go back on a deal like that again. Trust is the most important "
"factor in a business like yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"Yes, sir! I've definitely learned my lesson. Rest assured, I'll never let "
"anything like this happen again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"I should hope not! Well, here's 100,000 yen for the fish. Let me know if "
"any other good stuff comes in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "Of course! Please come again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"I really can't thank you enough, Kiryu-san. My customers' trust is so "
"important to me. How can I repay you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"Oh, I know! This plate's been handed down through generations here at my "
"shop. I'm sure it's valuable... Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Silver Plate<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid ""
"All's well that ends well, right? And if you're ever on the lookout for "
"some tasty fish, you know where to go!"
msgstr ""

